    "updated_at": "2025-01-17T13:39:18Z",
    "body": "I use tfenv and was able to make starship pick it up automatically by just setting the block explicitly in `starship.toml`\n\n```toml\n[terraform]\nformat = '[TF $version]($style) '\n```\n\nPS a nice terraform icon exists in most \"Nerd Font\" packages, you can use that but Github doesn't support it here",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
