    "created_at": "2025-07-11T11:42:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-11T11:42:54Z",
    "body": "For anyone still wanting tfenv support you can achieve this with a custom module in your starship.toml file\n\n```toml\n[custom.tfenv]\ncommand = 'echo \"v$(tfenv version-name) $(terraform workspace show)\"'\nformat = '[$symbol($output )]($style) '\nstyle = 'bold 105'\nsymbol = ' '\ndetect_extensions = ['tf', 'tfplan ', 'tfstate', 'terraform-version']\ndetect_folders = ['.terraform']\n\n[terraform]\ndisabled = true\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
